### IntelliJ HTTP Client: configure accessToken in your PRIVATE environment only.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@date = 2026-10-29
@courseId = REPLACE_WITH_OWN_ORIGINAL_COURSE_UUID
@semesterId = REPLACE_WITH_OWN_ORIGINAL_SEMESTER_UUID

### Current ISO week, using the account profile time zone
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pomodoro-statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Week containing the chosen local date, Monday through Sunday
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pomodoro-statistics?period=WEEK&date={{date}}&timeZone=Asia%2FHo_Chi_Minh
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Whole calendar month; days with no completed sessions remain zero buckets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pomodoro-statistics?period=MONTH&date={{date}}&timeZone=Asia%2FHo_Chi_Minh
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Optional original snapshot semester/course filters (even after source deletion)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pomodoro-statistics?period=MONTH&date={{date}}&semesterId={{semesterId}}&courseId={{courseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Invalid period -> 400 INVALID_POMODORO_STATISTICS_FILTER
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pomodoro-statistics?period=DAY
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
